				<note nid="n15002069.69">
				</note>
			</v>
			<marker class="begin-verse" mid="v15002070">
			</marker>
			<v n="70">
				Now the 
				<crossref let="j" cid="c15002070.139">
				</crossref>
				priests, the, 
				<crossref let="k" cid="c15002070.140">
				</crossref>
				Levites, some of the people, the singers, the gatekeepers, and the temple servants lived in their towns, and all the rest of Israel(3) in their towns. Footnotes (1) 2:69 A *daric* was a coin weighing about 1/4 ounce or 8.5 grams (2) 2:69 A *mina* was about 1 1/4 pounds or 0.6 kilogram (3) 2:70 Hebrew *all Israel* (ESV)
			</v>
